with a compatible ngspice build. The ngspice source code is primarily licensed
under the Modified BSD license, with selected files under LGPL-family and other
compatible licenses as documented by upstream ngspice.

Bundled license texts:

- LICENSES/ngspice-BSD-3-Clause.txt
